cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use recall or its evaluation study, please cite it using the
  metadata below. The study is in docs/paper.md.
type: software
title: "recall: local, bilingual semantic search over a technical book library"
abstract: >-
  recall indexes a Markdown library of technical books into SQLite (float32
  vectors and FTS5) with a local ONNX embedding model, and serves cited
  passages to a coding assistant through a fail-open prompt hook and an MCP
  server. Queries can be written in Spanish or English.
authors:
  - alias: andreshma
version: 0.3.0
date-released: "2026-11-09"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/andreshma/recall"
url: "https://github.com/andreshma/recall"
keywords:
  - retrieval-augmented generation
  - semantic search
  - embeddings
  - sqlite
  - onnx
  - mcp
references:
